correctness[where-binding]: `where` binds result type `T`, not method
 --> positive.jl:1:1
  |
1 | same(x::T)::T where {T} = x
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `where` attaches to result annotation
  |             ----------- parsed as `T where …`
  |
  = why: method gets no type parameter: call errors, or uses global of same name
  = fix: replace with `(same(x::T)::T) where {T}`   [safe]
  = docs: corset explain where-binding

correctness[where-binding]: `where` binds result type `T`, not method
 --> positive.jl:2:1
  |
2 | first_of(v::Vector{T})::T where T = v[1]
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `where` attaches to result annotation
  |                         --------- parsed as `T where …`
  |
  = why: method gets no type parameter: call errors, or uses global of same name
  = fix: replace with `(first_of(v::Vector{T})::T) where T`   [safe]
  = docs: corset explain where-binding

